  required to offer it, and the repository that publishes this License text
  does not supply that authority.

When an adopting project identifies an Upstream Repository and Official
Reporting Location:

* Fork that Upstream Repository.
* Make Your Covered Software changes in that public fork.
* Submit the complete covered delta through the designated public project
  mechanism no later than the first Monetization Event.

